<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Academic Administration</h2>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p><br>For academic enquiries, please contact us at <strong><a href="mailto:academicadmin@ium.monaco.edu" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">academicadmin@ium.monaco.edu</a></strong></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Visit Us </h2>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Address</h4>



<p>International University of Monaco<br>Le Stella, 14 Rue Hubert Clerissi<br>98000 Monaco – Principality of Monaco</p>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">You are also more than welcome to visit us</h4>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>At IUM during our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.monaco.edu/fairs-open-days/">Open Days</a>.</li>
</ul>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">You&#8217;re welcome at any time.</h4>



<p>Don&#8217;t worry if you can&#8217;t come to an Open Day. The admissions team will be glad to organize a tour of the university and provide you with all the information concerning our program.&nbsp;Request an appointment by sending us an email at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:admissions@monaco.edu">admissions@monaco.edu</a>.</p>



<p></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>All around the world during one of our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.monaco.edu/fairs-open-days/">Fairs</a>.<br><br>The International University of Monaco is a member of OMNES Education one of the largest French educational institutions with campuses in Paris, Lyon, Bordeaux, Chambéry-Savoie, Abidjan, Barcelona, Geneva, London, Monaco, Munich, Montreux, and San Francisco, which trains 30,000 students and 5,000 managers every year.</li>
</ul>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-create-block-niji-gutenberg-video-content"><div class="wrapper-content"><div class="video-heading"><h2 class="testimonials-title" data-filigrane="">360° VIRTUAL TOUR</h2><p class="video-subtitle subtitle">Explore the International University of Monaco</p></div><div class="video-wrap"><figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper"><iframe data-lazy-src="//www.youtube.com/embed/eGi50VHlfbQ" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></figure></div></div></div></div>
</div>



<p></p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Getting Here </h2>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><br>Motorway and Road Network</h4>



<p>By motorway A8 exit Monaco. From Nice airport, the Principality may be reached in less than 30 minutes.</p>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">By Road</h4>



<p>Between Nice and Monaco, one may take three roads:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>The “Basse Corniche” (Low Coast-Road – Highway 98), along the seaside</li>



<li>The “Moyenne Corniche” (Middle Coast-Road – Highway N7), going through Eze-Village</li>



<li>The “Grande Corniche” (Great Coast-Road), going through La Turbie and Col d’Eze</li>
</ul>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Railways </h4>



<p>All trains stop at Monaco/Monte-Carlo Station which is located 2mn away from the International University of Monaco.</p>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Bus </h4>



<p>Bus 110 stops at MONACO “Place d’Armes” which is located 200m away from IUM.</p>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Airlines</h4>



<p>The nearest airport is located in Nice, France. Bus, helicopter (Heli Air Monaco or Monacair) and taxis are available to help you get to Monaco. For more information, please <a href="https://www.monaco.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/05/HOUSING-GUIDE-FAQ-2024-2025.pdf">click here. </a></p>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:63px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div style="height:100px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



